  "description": "Locris Ozolia or Ozolian Locris was a region of Ancient Greece. The Ozolian Locrians inhabited this area that was situated on the Corinthian Gulf and was bounded to the north by Doris, to the east by Phocis, and to the west by Aetolia.",
